## Signature

- Provided by: **Space Bunny (opencode/space-bunny-free)** — 2026-10-02
- Method: Public internet research of OpenCode's official Zen model list, Zen documentation and public usage data, the OpenCode issue tracker, and four independent model indexes (modelcompare.dev, LLM Directory, models.dev, llm-stats) plus Artificial Analysis, Vals AI and BenchLM. No peer `model/` findings file was read before or during this research, and no proxy model's benchmark was substituted. Scores are not produced; this file is a negative-findings record.
- Future sources: if OpenCode publishes a per-model capability or benchmark table for Fledge Alpha, or a vendor claims the model, add a new scored file next to this one using the same headings. Also re-check when the 2026-10-02 "Endpoint is unavailable" outage is confirmed resolved and when the Zen free tier's training-data policy is restated in writing.

